<title>FRANCE: Air France to lift ex-France cargo rates.</title>
<headline>Air France to lift ex-France cargo rates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France Cargo is to raise some tariffs for cargo leaving France by between three and eight percent on March 1, the French state airline said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Main destinations affected will be South and North America, French-speaking Africa and Asia, although not Japan, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give a reason for the increase. -- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
